# DIM8 BT Thermometer — Git ignore policy
#
# Patterns are deliberately narrow where a broad rule could hide evidence.
# Raw BLE advertisement fixtures used by decoder tests must remain trackable
# (see AGENTS.md), so do not add blanket capture, data, or binary patterns.

# Human-facing reports and handoffs remain local to the owner's checkout.
/for-user/
/raw-assets/

# Local agent settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
# The wrapper JAR must stay tracked so builds are reproducible.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Kotlin compiler sessions and error reports
.kotlin/

# Android SDK paths and machine-specific build configuration
local.properties

# Android build outputs
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.apks
*.dex
*.class
output-metadata.json

# Native build caches
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/

# Signing material and local secrets. Never commit release keys.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
.env
.env.*

# Android Studio / IntelliJ
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
# Root only: Android Studio's profiler output directory. Anchored so that a
# test fixture directory named "captures" is not ignored.
/captures/

# Runtime diagnostics and heap dumps
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Operating system and editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
